hran_pacman
=============

Tool library dedicated to software package downloading.

Detailed documentation can be found under [docs/index.rst](docs/index.rst) file.

In order to read documentation as HTML, please clone this repository and build by following dedicated guide that you can find under 
[docs/how_to_guides/how_to_build_this_documentation.rst](docs/how_to_guides/how_to_build_this_documentation.rst)


Requirements
============

* Python>=2.7.10



Installation
============


Test lines with HRAN workspace
------------------------------


pip install -U hran_pacman


Test lines without HRAN workspace
---------------------------------


pip install -U -i https://pypi.dynamic.nsn-net.net/panda/pypi hran_pacman


Enhancements
============

Ideas to enhance pacman (moved from [TAT-12554](https://jira3.int.net.nokia.com/browse/TAT-12554))

- [ ] Change problematic locking system, which not always works properly
- [ ] Create working system of packages checksum verification
- [ ] Add jenkins-focused progress bar implementation
- [ ] Change package downloading strategies
- [ ] Rewrite/redesign library to allow better features and systems, also fix all requested problems.
